			"notes": "Still on 1.21.8, still requires ViaFabricPlus, with an upgrade.\n\nUpdate includes:\n\n- Integrated withering as a step within the Highway Gooner module.\n- Added guardrails to prevent a bad wither placement.\n- Added basic inventory checking for wither replenishing, accounting for renamed stacks.\n- Added stricter hotbar slot selection for placement blocks (withering causes 2 hotbar slots used, care)\n- Added distance and inventory based calc to determine if a wither should be placed safely.\n- Fixed an autowalk bug where it broke when attempting to walk over a hole.\n\nReport bugs in Discord."
		},
